- `resolveFinalStatus(currentStatus, issueType, jiraConfig)` — needs hasStage. The ticket objects are fetched right before the call:
  - In `finalizeAlreadyMergedTestCase(ticketKey, branchName, issueType, jiraConfig)`: `const ticket = getTracker().getIssue(ticketKey);` → flat-ish view via getIssue → Jira-shaped `{ fields: { status: { name }, labels }`.
